":30,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#0f172a","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":372357221,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":30,"angle":0,"y":20,"width":1200},{"isDeleted":false,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#1d4ed8","link":null,"roughness":0,"groupIds":[],"index":"a1","backgroundColor":"#dbeafe","angle":0,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":2,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1771325198517,"id":"input_box","x":30,"seed":2,"boundElements":[],"y":80,"opacity":100,"height":560,"width":280,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":1764764779},{"seed":3,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"input_text","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":15,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1771325198517,"locked":false,"text":"Input Sources\n\n- Git: log, shortlog, remote URL\n- README\/docs\n- package.json\n- pyproject.toml\n- requirements*.txt\n- .csproj\n- Dockerfile\n- docker-compose*.yml\n- values*.yaml \/ Chart.yaml\n- .env*\n- CI config files\n\nEntry:\nContextManager(repo_path, llm, containers)","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"a2","containerId":null,"baseline":254,"originalText":"Input Sources\n\n- Git: log, shortlog, remote URL\n- README\/docs\n- package.json\n- pyproject.toml\n- requirements*.txt\n- .csproj\n- Dockerfile\n- docker-compose*.yml\n- values*.yaml \/ Chart.yaml\n- .env*\n- CI config files\n\nEntry:\nContextManager(repo_path, llm, containers)","height":260,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e3a8a","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":579298245,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":48,"angle":0,"y":98,"width":246},{"isDeleted":false,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#047857","link":null,"roughness":0,"groupIds":[],"index":"a3","backgroundColor":"#d1fae5","angle":0,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":2,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1771325198517,"id":"proc_box","x":340,"seed":4,"boundElements":[],"y":80,"opacity":100,"height":560,"width":520,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":921003787},{"seed":5,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"proc_text","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1771325198517,"locked":false,"text":"Step-by-step\n\n1) SystemDetector.detect_system_name\n   package.json -> pyproject -> README title -> .sln\/.csproj -> dir name\n\n2) SystemDetector.generate_system_purpose\n   README first good sentence, else optional LLM\n\n3) SystemDetector metadata\n   environments, app_version, tags, api_spec_url, documentation_url,\n   monitoring_url, regulatory_frameworks\n\n4) DependencyDetector.detect_external_dependencies\n   parse manifests + helm + env + README + NuGet + inferred platforms\n\n5) DependencyDetector.detect_deployment_dependencies\n   collect Docker images \/ compose runtime images\n\n6) DependencyDetector.detect_dependency_freshness_alerts\n   requirements\/pyproject\/package.json version hygiene\n\n7) SystemDetector.detect_languages + detect_frameworks + detect_context_actors\n\n8) SystemDetector.extract_git_metadata + get_repository_root_url + context_sources\n\n9) MetadataDetector core fields\n   owner, domain, tier, data_class\n\n10) MetadataDetector operational fields\n    status + status_evidence, active_experts, git_activity, dora_metrics, on_call\n\n11) MetadataDetector.assess_compliance_risk\n    risk rules + deterministic 7 checks -> compliance\/confidence\/factors\n\n12) ContextManager builds final context dict + relationships","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"a4","containerId":null,"baseline":505,"originalText":"Step-by-step\n\n1) SystemDetector.detect_system_name\n   package.json -> pyproject -> README title -> .sln\/.csproj -> dir name\n\n2) SystemDetector.generate_system_purpose\n   README first good sentence, else optional LLM\n\n3) SystemDetector metadata\n   environments, app_version, tags, api_spec_url, documentation_url,\n   monitoring_url, regulatory_frameworks\n\n4) DependencyDetector.detect_external_dependencies\n   parse manifests + helm + env + README + NuGet + inferred platforms\n\n5) DependencyDetector.detect_deployment_dependencies\n   collect Docker images \/ compose runtime images\n\n6) DependencyDetector.detect_dependency_freshness_alerts\n   requirements\/pyproject\/package.json version hygiene\n\n7) SystemDetector.detect_languages + detect_frameworks + detect_context_actors\n\n8) SystemDetector.extract_git_metadata + get_repository_root_url + context_sources\n\n9) MetadataDetector core fields\n   owner, domain, tier, data_class\n\n10) MetadataDetector operational fields\n    status + status_evidence, active_experts, git_activity, dora_metrics, on_call\n\n11) MetadataDetector.assess_compliance_risk\n    risk rules + deterministic 7 checks -> compliance\/confidence\/factors\n\n12) ContextManager builds final context dict + relationships","height":510,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#065f46","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":567321381,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":358,"angle":0,"y":98,"width":486},{"isDeleted":false,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#b45309","link":null,"roughness":0,"groupIds":[],"index":"a5","backgroundColor":"#fef3c7","angle":0,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":2,"roundness":{"type":3},"type":"rectangle","updated":1771325198517,"id":"out_box","x":890,"seed":6,"boundElements":[],"y":80,"opacity":100,"height":560,"width":360,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":458902955},{"seed":7,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"out_text","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":14,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1771325198517,"locked":false,"text":"Output Fields (context dict)\n\nIdentity\n- c4_level, type, name, purpose, description, llm_description\n\nDependencies\n- external_dependencies\n- deployment_dependencies\n- dependency_freshness_alerts\n\nTech + context\n- actors, languages, frameworks\n- repository_url, git, context_sources\n- environment, app_version, tags\n- api_spec_url, documentation_url, monitoring_url\n- regulatory_frameworks\n\nPrimary service fields\n- domain, owner, status, tier, data_class, active_experts, compliance\n\nAudit\/ops fields\n- owner_contributors, owner_contributor_stats, contributor_count\n- status_evidence\n- compliance_confidence, compliance_factors\n- last_commit_date, commit_count_30d\/90d\/180d\n- dora_metrics, on_call_channel\n\nLegacy aliases\n- owner_team, business_domain, criticality","version":2,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","roundness":null,"index":"a6","containerId":null,"baseline":505,"originalText":"Output Fields (context dict)\n\nIdentity\n- c4_level, type, name, purpose, description, llm_description\n\nDependencies\n- external_dependencies\n- deployment_dependencies\n- dependency_freshness_alerts\n\nTech + context\n- actors, languages, frameworks\n- repository_url, git, context_sources\n- environment, app_version, tags\n- api_spec_url, documentation_url, monitoring_url\n- regulatory_frameworks\n\nPrimary service fields\n- domain, owner, status, tier, data_class, active_experts, compliance\n\nAudit\/ops fields\n- owner_contributors, owner_contributor_stats, contributor_count\n- status_evidence\n- compliance_confidence, compliance_factors\n- last_commit_date, commit_count_30d\/90d\/180d\n- dora_metrics, on_call_channel\n\nLegacy aliases\n- owner_team, business_domain, criticality","height":510,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#92400e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":410711685,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":[],"x":908,"angle":0,"y":98,"width":326},{"versionNonce":2042191947,"isDeleted":false,"locked":false,"st